Z-Anatomy, by Gauthier Kervyn, CC BY-SA 4.0.
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
models/supplement.glb contains only meshes from that project that BodyParts3D does not already name.
The non-commercial inner-ear model (University of Dundee, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and the non-commercial kidney model (Lissie Cowley, CC BY-NC 4.0) are not included.
This file stays separate so its share-alike terms are not mixed into the other models.

Female model: Browne, Kristen, and Heidi Schlehlein. 2026. 3D Reference Organ Set for Female, v1.10.
https://doi.org/10.48539/HBM637.DWBM.744
HuBMAP CCF 3D Reference Object Library. CC BY 4.0.
Pregnancy meshes (placenta and umbilical cord) were removed. The set is organs plus a partial skeleton.
